%F A029402 a(n) = floor((242*n^3+105*n^2+228*n+144)/144) - floor((n^3+4*n+1)/5) - floor((4*n^3+4*n+2)/7) - floor((10*n^3+8*n^2+2*n+8)/11). - _Hoang Xuan Thanh_, Jul 30 2026
